			"updated": 1791280747073,
			"created": 1790666049995,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Pattern: choreographed ?\n\nConsistency: Atomic for only this component vs\neventual for overall answer message lifecycle.\n\nFailures:\n- API coarse check (auth, rate limits, payload size,\nbasic schema)\n- Ingestion Service (domain validation, schema,\ntimestamp)\n\nTest Taker has retry mechanism or aborts the submit.\n\n ",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "m3ol69Zhpju7nsnbbCmGO",
			"originalText": "Pattern: choreographed ?\n\nConsistency: Atomic for only this component vs\neventual for overall answer message lifecycle.\n\nFailures:\n- API coarse check (auth, rate limits, payload size,\nbasic schema)\n- Ingestion Service (domain validation, schema,\ntimestamp)\n\nTest Taker has retry mechanism or aborts the submit.\n\n ",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "Pattern: choreographed ?\n\nConsistency: Atomic for only this component vs\neventual for overall answer message lifecycle.\n\nFailures:\n- API coarse check (auth, rate limits, payload size,\nbasic schema)\n- Ingestion Service (domain validation, schema,\ntimestamp)\n\nTest Taker has retry mechanism or aborts the submit.\n\n ",
			"link": null
		},
